  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7000801",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700080101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700080101": {
            "id": "700080101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "It seems that we must come up with a new special blend after all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080102"
            ]
          },
          "700080102": {
            "id": "700080102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080103"
            ]
          },
          "700080103": {
            "id": "700080103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Oh, it's you. Actually, I was just considering pushing out a new special beverage based on the Windblume Festival.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080104"
            ]
          },
          "700080104": {
            "id": "700080104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Everyone's going to be having fun in the city during this time, and I'm sure that they wouldn't mind having some food and drink to go along with that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080105"
            ]
          },
          "700080105": {
            "id": "700080105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "However, they'll get drunk very quickly if all they drink is alcohol, and they'll be liable to get pulled aside by the Knights until they've sobered up...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080106"
            ]
          },
          "700080106": {
            "id": "700080106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Also, it'll ruin the mood if the reek of alcohol is too strong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080107"
            ]
          },
          "700080107": {
            "id": "700080107",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Huh. Is that so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080108"
            ]
          },
          "700080108": {
            "id": "700080108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Well, I've heard that some people really enjoy that sort of hazy, drunken atmosphere. But falling over drunk by the roadside during a festival just isn't a good look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080109"
            ]
          },
          "700080109": {
            "id": "700080109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "As such, I've decided to create a refreshing, non-alcoholic drink that's milk-based and filled with the flavor of the \"wind.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080110"
            ]
          },
          "700080110": {
            "id": "700080110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "To emphasize the flavor of the \"wind,\" I think that we could also use two special additions — Dandelions and Windwheel Asters.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080111"
            ]
          },
          "700080111": {
            "id": "700080111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "But we'll be here all day if I'm the only one going around collecting them. So, Traveler, could you help me collect some accessorizing ingredients?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080113",
              "700080117"
            ]
          },
          "700080113": {
            "id": "700080113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Thanks so much. I've heard that the Dandelions of Starsnatch Cliff are of rather fine quality, so do help me get some.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080114"
            ]
          },
          "700080114": {
            "id": "700080114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "I'll go collect some Windwheel Asters as well, and we'll meet back here once we're done collecting our respective ingredients.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080115"
            ]
          },
          "700080115": {
            "id": "700080115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "We'll make the drink right on the spot, and get a few people to try it out while we're at it..."
          },
          "700080117": {
            "id": "700080117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "I'm counting on you, then — the Windwheel Asters of Windrise are of rather fine quality, so please try collecting some there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080118"
            ]
          },
          "700080118": {
            "id": "700080118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "I'll go collect some Dandelions Seeds for my part, and we'll meet back here once we're done collecting our respective ingredients.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700080119"
            ]
          },
          "700080119": {
            "id": "700080119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "We'll make the drink right on the spot, and get a few people to try it out while we're at it..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
