    {
      "subId": "7000810",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Margaret",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081001": {
            "id": "700081001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Ah, you're done with the blending process?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081002"
            ]
          },
          "700081002": {
            "id": "700081002",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And we're done."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000818",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Margaret",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081503"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081503": {
            "id": "700081503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081504"
            ]
          },
          "700081504": {
            "id": "700081504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "There's a slight sweetness to the piercing foretaste, and there's also a cooling texture, like that of the flowing breeze...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081505"
            ]
          },
          "700081505": {
            "id": "700081505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "A most fitting drink for the Windblume Festival. I see I made the right choice in bringing you on board.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081506"
            ]
          },
          "700081506": {
            "id": "700081506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Next, I think this drink needs some taste testers. Traveler, could I trouble you to go out again to look for some?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081507"
            ]
          },
          "700081507": {
            "id": "700081507",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll see this done.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081508"
            ]
          },
          "700081508": {
            "id": "700081508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "I'll be relying on you, then. I believe there'll be tons of people near the Anemo Archon statue. You can probably find some testers there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000819",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Margaret",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081003"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081003": {
            "id": "700081003",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081004"
            ]
          },
          "700081004": {
            "id": "700081004",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "It tastes a little astringent. The flavors don't seem to have melded together too well. Perhaps something went awry during the blending process...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081005"
            ]
          },
          "700081005": {
            "id": "700081005",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Hmm... Give it another go, perhaps. If you have any questions, I'll be right here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000811",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Nimrod",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081101": {
            "id": "700081101",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "*sigh* Festivals just aren't complete without a little swig of drink...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081102"
            ]
          },
          "700081102": {
            "id": "700081102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hey there, The Cat's Tail's come up with a new beverage...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081103"
            ]
          },
          "700081103": {
            "id": "700081103",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "Oh, you want me to test it, do you? Hahaha! No problem, none at all! I'm an old hand when it comes to wine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081104"
            ]
          },
          "700081104": {
            "id": "700081104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "Let me try it... Eh? This... doesn't have any taste of alcohol at all. It's more like some sort of dairy product.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081105"
            ]
          },
          "700081105": {
            "id": "700081105",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "Don't get me wrong, it tastes good, but I don't think a non-alcoholic drink really fits this festival.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081106"
            ]
          },
          "700081106": {
            "id": "700081106",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Nimrod",
            "text": "I mean, there are lots of people who're looking forward to getting reasonably drunk this Windblume Festival. I don't think this sort of drink would receive a particularly warm welcome."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000812",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Aramis",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081201": {
            "id": "700081201",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Aramis",
            "text": "Hello. Can I help you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081202"
            ]
          },
          "700081202": {
            "id": "700081202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hey there, The Cat's Tail's come up with a new beverage...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081203"
            ]
          },
          "700081203": {
            "id": "700081203",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Aramis",
            "text": "My apologies, but I'm on duty at the moment. I can't drink.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081204"
            ]
          },
          "700081204": {
            "id": "700081204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This drink's non-alcoholic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081205"
            ]
          },
          "700081205": {
            "id": "700081205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Aramis",
            "text": "Oh? Well... then... I guess it'll be fine. I'm feeling a little thirsty, in any case, so I'll give it a go...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081206"
            ]
          },
          "700081206": {
            "id": "700081206",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Aramis",
            "text": "Oh! This is pretty good. It's refreshing, too. Really perks you right up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081207"
            ]
          },
          "700081207": {
            "id": "700081207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Aramis",
            "text": "This is a new product from The Cat's Tail, is it? I'll go have another taste later when I can spare the time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000813",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Nora",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081301": {
            "id": "700081301",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nora",
            "text": "Do you wanna play with me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081302"
            ]
          },
          "700081302": {
            "id": "700081302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hey there, The Cat's Tail's come up with a new beverage...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081303"
            ]
          },
          "700081303": {
            "id": "700081303",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nora",
            "text": "The Cat's Tail... Aunty Grace says that kids shouldn't drink wine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081304"
            ]
          },
          "700081304": {
            "id": "700081304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Oh, this one's got no wine in it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081305"
            ]
          },
          "700081305": {
            "id": "700081305",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nora",
            "text": "Really? I'll give it a try...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081306"
            ]
          },
          "700081306": {
            "id": "700081306",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nora",
            "text": "It's really nice! It's sweet, and it's cool! Is this a new drink from The Cat's Tail?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081307"
            ]
          },
          "700081307": {
            "id": "700081307",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Nora",
            "text": "I'll tell Timmie and Lily, too! I'm sure they'd like some!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000814",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Margaret",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081401": {
            "id": "700081401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "How did it go? Were you able to find some taste testers?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081402"
            ]
          },
          "700081402": {
            "id": "700081402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Oh, I found some, alright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081403"
            ]
          },
          "700081403": {
            "id": "700081403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Getting reasonably drunk during the festival, huh... No wonder the crowd at the Angel's Share has grown...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081404"
            ]
          },
          "700081404": {
            "id": "700081404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Still, I think this is fine. Other than those who'd like to get reasonably drunk, the children and the city guards should get to enjoy their own fair share of festive cheer as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081405"
            ]
          },
          "700081405": {
            "id": "700081405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "I'll continue tweaking this special blend. Thanks for your help, by the way — and here's a little something as thanks.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081406"
            ]
          },
          "700081406": {
            "id": "700081406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Ah, yes — and Happy Windblume Festival."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000818",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700081801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700081801": {
            "id": "700081801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Have you found the ingredients?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700081802"
            ]
          },
          "700081802": {
            "id": "700081802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "These are some very fine Windwheel Asters. I wonder what flavors we'll achieve if we use these in our blend..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000828",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700082802"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700082802": {
            "id": "700082802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "These are some very fine Dandelions. I wonder what flavors we'll achieve if we use these in our blend..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7000851",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700085101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700085101": {
            "id": "700085101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Forgotten the steps? No worries. I'll go over the process again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700085102"
            ]
          },
          "700085102": {
            "id": "700085102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "First, place the <color=#00E1FFFF>Sweet Flower</color> in before drizzling some <color=#00E1FFFF>Milk</color> in to lay the foundations for the clear, sweet texture we're going for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700085103"
            ]
          },
          "700085103": {
            "id": "700085103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "We'll need to add the <color=#00E1FFFF>Windwheel Aster</color> in at this point to add flavor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700085104"
            ]
          },
          "700085104": {
            "id": "700085104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Don't rush to mix it all together. Let it <color=#00E1FFFF>sit</color> for a moment and let the floral fragrance emerge.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700085105"
            ]
          },
          "700085105": {
            "id": "700085105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Margaret",
            "text": "Then scatter the <color=#00E1FFFF>Dandelion Seeds</color> in and place some <color=#00E1FFFF>ice cubes</color> atop them, and that'll just about wrap it up. If you've gotten all that, you can try it yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
